  "body": "## What changed\n- Added `CornerRelief` (`None`, `Dogbone`, `TBone`), `TBoneDirection` (`LongEdge`, `ShortEdge`, `Horizontal`, `Vertical`), and per-corner `overrides` to `OpParams::Pocket`, `OpParams::Adaptive2D`, and `OpParams::Offset2D`.\n- Implemented inside-corner detection (with micro-fillet chord collapse) and relief spur splicing in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/corner_relief.rs` and `corner_relief_spur.rs`, plus corner-blend ban seeding in `pocket_emit.rs`.\n- Added operation safety checks in `crates/app/src/operation/corner_relief.rs` for stock bounds, `Exclude` and open far-side regions, `DoNotTouch` keepouts, kept/neighbour steel, and multi-height thin-wall punch-throughs.\n- Refused `Adaptive2D::Trochoidal` with active corner relief by name in `crates/app/src/operation/types/sane.rs`, `generate.rs`, and the UI panel.\n- Added strictly bounded verification corridors (`CornerReliefZone`) in `crates/sim/src/verify/corner_relief.rs`, `crates/sim/src/stock_sim/corner_relief.rs`, and `crates/app/src/operation/corner_relief_sim.rs`.\n- Wired project serialization, MCP `set_operation` round-trip, WCS yaw transforms, UI controls (`kind_editors.rs`, `mill2d_page.rs`), and the decision note in `docs/decisions/2400-corner-relief.md`.\n\n## Cause\nInside sharp corners of closed 2D pockets and square slots always leave unmachined corner fillets equal to the cutter radius. Adding opt-in bisector (`Dogbone`) or tangent (`TBone`) spurs extends the cutter center to the true corner reach while pre-emission guards and bounded verification zones block wall gouges and punch-throughs.\n\n## Tests\n- Pinning suites:\n  - `crates/motion/tests/corner_relief.rs`: 5 passed, 0 failed (`inside_corners_finds_rectangle_and_micro_fillet_corners`, `dogbone_and_tbone_rules_plan_cleanly_on_rectangle`, `pocket_strategies_and_blend_turns_emit_relief_spurs`, `positive_stock_to_leave_offsets_relief_by_tool_plus_leave`, `unreachable_corners_and_bad_overrides_are_refused`), run after the final edit.\n  - `crates/app/tests/corner_relief.rs`: red before the fix (0 passed, 6 failed); 7 passed, 0 failed after the final edit (`pocket_waterline_square_dogbone_matches_golden`, `unreachable_corner_in_narrow_keyway_is_refused_by_name`, `square_slot_tbone_rule_and_per_corner_override`, `mcp_set_operation_and_project_roundtrip_preserve_corner_relief`, `relief_exiting_stock_or_thin_wall_or_exclude_is_refused_by_name`, `square_cad_pocket_dogbone_clears_corners_and_verifies_without_gouge`, `adaptive2d_spiral_and_offset2d_support_relief_while_trochoidal_and_do_not_touch_refuse`).\n- Mutation checks (each confirmed red when disabled and green when restored):\n  1. `crates/motion/src/machining2d/pocket.rs`: omitting `&plan.reliefs` failed `pocket_waterline_square_dogbone_matches_golden` (18 moves vs 26 moves).\n  2. `crates/motion/src/machining2d/corner_relief.rs`: disabling the `WALL_CLEAR_TOL` crossing check failed `unreachable_corner_in_narrow_keyway_is_refused_by_name`.\n  3. `crates/app/src/operation/corner_relief.rs`: disabling `part_slices` thin-wall checks failed `relief_exiting_stock_or_thin_wall_or_exclude_is_refused_by_name`.\n  4. `crates/sim/src/verify/corner_relief.rs`: returning an empty list from `valid_zones` failed `square_cad_pocket_dogbone_clears_corners_and_verifies_without_gouge` with 16 `Gouge` warnings.\n- Gate and clippy:\n  - `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: 774 of 776 steps passed on the initial run; `operation::params::size_tests::params_files_stay_under_the_line_law` was fixed by moving `write_corner_relief` to `crates/app/src/operation/params/digest.rs`, and `ui suites: lib` passed on re-run after a transient `model_link_tests` mtime flake and one transient SIGSEGV under parallel execution.\n  - After the final edit (`mill2d_page.rs` formatting restore and `docs/decisions/2400-corner-relief.md`), `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main --only \"app suites: lib\" --only \"app suites: corner_relief\" --only \"ui suites: lib\" --only \"ui suites: operations\"` passed (4 steps, 0 failed) and `camcraft-motion --test corner_relief` passed (5 passed, 0 failed).\n  - `cargo clippy -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-sim -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed cleanly prior to moving `write_corner_relief` into `digest.rs` and restoring two unrelated `height_editor` formatting lines in `mill2d_page.rs`; re-running clippy after those edits was blocked by host `sccache` daemon connection timeouts on `127.0.0.1:4228` (`clippy-driver -vV`).\n\n## Goldens moved\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/pocket_waterline_square_dogbone.cl` (new golden, 28 lines, 26 moves showing dogbone relief corners at `±7879` um for a 6 mm flat end mill in a 20 mm square pocket).\n\n## Not exercised\n- `cargo xtask gate heavy`, `cargo xtask gate release` (`SLOW_BINARIES`), the UI snapshot PNG lane, and interactive GUI corner selection.\n\n## Overlaps\n- Touches `crates/app/src/mcp/edit.rs` in a different function (`corner_relief_kept` vs `add_tool`/`set_stock` in `#2773`); whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nEffort: high\nChangelog: Add dogbone and T-bone inside-corner relief for closed 2D pockets and square slots.\nFixes #2400\n",
